WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.543
(suspenseful music)

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:02.753
(animal whistling)

00:00:02.753 --> 00:00:04.171
[Narrator] On June 16th

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:06.632
[Vocalizing the Friday the 13th
theme]

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:07.966
[Morgan] Baby, stop playin'!

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:08.800
[Shawn] Wait, hold up.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.135
I know I left this door open.

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:11.637
[Narrator] See the
horror film

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:16.099
preview audiences are calling
a killer experience.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:18.852
[Lisa] The Blackening.
(creature roaring)

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.187
[Dewayne] No, no thank you.

00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:21.813
[King] Probably runs
on racism.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.190
[The Killer] Pick a card.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:24.733
(suspenseful music)
Or you die.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:27.611
- In your predicament,

00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:29.613
the Black character is
always the first to die.

00:00:29.613 --> 00:00:32.574
I will spare your lives if
you sacrifice the person

00:00:32.574 --> 00:00:33.534
you deem the Blackest.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:35.369
[Clifton] Guys, I can prove
I'm not the Blackest.

00:00:35.369 --> 00:00:36.203
[Shanika] Prove it.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:38.622
- I thought Black Twitter
was a type of seasoning.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.666
I like Jimmy Fallon
without The Roots?

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:41.750
- Eh! Wrong.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.709
- I voted for Trump.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.044
(suspenseful music)
(audience gasping)

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:44.795
- What?
- What?

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:47.589
- Twice.
- You--

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:49.383
(audience laughing)
(audience clapping)

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:50.759
(bell dings)
- Your time is up.

00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:52.135
It's time to die.

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:54.221
(dart whistling)
(dart thumping)

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:57.266
(audience screaming)

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:59.601
♪ Let's go ♪
(electronic music)

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:02.020
- [Allison] What do we do?
- Call the cops?

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:04.231
(all laughing)

00:01:04.231 --> 00:01:06.233
(killer growling)
(audience screaming)

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:08.443
♪ Shots, shots ♪
- We need a plan.

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:09.278
- Let's get some weapons!

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:11.321
♪ Shots, shots, shots, shots ♪
- Wait. Chili powder?

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:12.656
Girl, what I finna do, cook?

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:13.740
- Sorry, girl, we ran
out of knives.

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.118
♪ Everybody ♪

00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:18.453
♪ Everybody ♪

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:19.288
(gunshot firing)
(person laughing)

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:20.455
♪ Everybody ♪

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:24.251
(killer laughing)
(audience screaming)

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:27.379
- Why Black women gotta save
everyone all the damn time?!

00:01:27.379 --> 00:01:29.506
- Oh, man.
- Woo.

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:31.591
♪ Shots, shots, shots,
shots, shots, shots ♪

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.760
(electronic music)

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.553
- Can we just go?

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.595
[Ranger White] Lock the
doors, get down.

00:01:35.595 --> 00:01:36.763
I'll be right back.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.932
[Audience] Boo!

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:43.061
(electronic music)

